            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, daruurtii Rabbigu maalintii taambuuggay dul joogi jirtay, habeenkiina waxaa daruurtii ku jiri jiray dab, reer binu Israa'iil oo dhammuna waxyaalahaas ayay arki jireen sodcaalladoodii oo dhan.",
          "type": "text",
